# Nucleus — cloud agent rules

**Weekly schedule:** Follow `AGENTS.md`. Target ≥97% aggregate on `ground-truth/` (baseline **99.2%**). Eval: `python -m canvas_parser.weekly_iteration --llm` → `.cache/weekly_iteration/report.json`.

**RAG / search:** Follow `graphagents.md`. Eval: `python scripts/eval_rag.py --production-cutoff`. Shared graph: `parser.py`, `llm_parse.py`, `canvas_graph.json`, `vector_retreival.py`.

**Guardrails:** General patterns only; no ground-truth title literals or course-specific date anchors. Do not replace weekly schedule with JS `buildWeeklySchedule`.
